{"3950720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wander Her Way VR", "steam_appid": 3950720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander the path of your charming companion. Discover her home, filled with portals to other worlds. Each location offers a unique VR experience. The game features both relaxing locations where you can unwind with a beautiful girl and worlds where you'll have to fight enemies. Explore VR from different perspectives with advanced physics, graphics, and destructible elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tIn the game you will find:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\tHome – a cozy place filled with interactive elements and VR activities. Pick up and move household items, smash fruit, turn on lights, open doors, throw balls, turn on taps, and much more. Relax in the company of a charming girl, with advanced graphics, mechanics, and physics. Throughout the house, you'll find portals that transport you to other incredible locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950720/extras/544cf5092b82c22b0dcccd9936bd88ee.avif?t=1778569765\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950720/extras_big/544cf5092b82c22b0dcccd9936bd88ee.avif?t=1778569765 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synthwave City - Return to the futuristic visions of the 80s with synthwave music. Relax and drive through an incredible neon city inspired by films and video games from that era. You can also drive into city areas where you'll battle robots and car drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950720/extras/aacf02a1556c31157016e902a559546a.avif?t=1778569765\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950720/extras_big/aacf02a1556c31157016e902a559546a.avif?t=1778569765 width=1560 height=840 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\tDrone Arena – a futuristic environment where you fight drones equipped with miniguns and rocket launchers. You can deploy turrets in the arena to help you deal with enemies. You can use a pistol, a rifle, and the help of your gorgeous girlfriend.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950720/extras/09f12019118bdfc1f4decbe4dae05239.avif?t=1778569765\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950720/extras_big/09f12019118bdfc1f4decbe4dae05239.avif?t=1778569765 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\tDance Stage - Take advantage of VR and dance with your charming girlfriend on stage. You can relax and admire her dance from a distance, dance next to her, or dance together while holding hands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950720/extras/6469ff50b5acb242e9d1eccecf961795.avif?t=1778569765\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950720/extras_big/6469ff50b5acb242e9d1eccecf961795.avif?t=1778569765 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\tHotel - The hotel has been taken over by mischievous kittens. You'll need to be quick and clever to catch them all and return them to their lairs. This won't be easy, as the kittens can turn into ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950720/extras/a1945f7e9a153342f999f0ecec3decfe.avif?t=1778569765\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950720/extras_big/a1945f7e9a153342f999f0ecec3decfe.avif?t=1778569765 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\tTower - Together with your companion, protect the tower from the evil robots. Defend yourself from waves of attacks and be careful not to fall from the tower. In addition to classic weapons, you have a powerful minigun at your disposal. The tower also contains many destructible objects, so you can use your destructive skills to reduce the interior to dust.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950720/extras/1f08f4cbf0974cb7cb5501092313f410.avif?t=1778569765\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950720/extras_big/1f08f4cbf0974cb7cb5501092313f410.avif?t=1778569765 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\tThe Mine - Your task is to reach the other end of the mine. Your path will be filled with speeding mine carts, numerous traps, skeletons, and giant rolling balls. Fortunately, your female companion will aid you in this adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950720/extras/b7fc2fff53a1fec86fc675e9bf3d30d8.avif?t=1778569765\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950720/extras_big/b7fc2fff53a1fec86fc675e9bf3d30d8.avif?t=1778569765 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\tFireworks Show - Walk hand in hand with your girlfriend among the charming townhouses to a spectacular fireworks show. Relax, but not too much, as a fight might await you on this stage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950720/extras/25159f45cf6a1384957e9f924cb8b462.avif?t=1778569765\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950720/extras_big/25159f45cf6a1384957e9f924cb8b462.avif?t=1778569765 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950720/extras/39565796bde1fee85923586157fcd673.avif?t=1778569765\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950720/extras_big/39565796bde1fee85923586157fcd673.avif?t=1778569765 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander the path of your charming companion. Discover her home, filled with portals to other worlds. Each location offers a unique VR experience. The game features both relaxing locations where you can unwind with a beautiful girl and worlds where you'll have to fight enemies. Explore VR from different perspectives with advanced physics, graphics, and destructi